________________________________________

Postnuptial vs Prenuptial Agreement
• Prenuptial Agreement = Signed before marriage
• Postnuptial Agreement = Signed after marriage

Both help protect finances and clarify expectations.

________________________________________

Does a Postnuptial Agreement Need Notarization?
Many jurisdictions recommend or require signatures, witnesses, and/or notarization for stronger enforceability.

